title: Luis Araquistáin
is-pinned-card: true
tags: advisor, left
card-image: img/es/leaders/araquistain.jpg
view-if: rosenfeld_advisor = 1
new-page: true

= Luis Araquistáin

Araquistáin is the leading intellectual of the Caballerista left, editor of *Leviatán* and theorist of the party's revolutionary turn. He favors a united front with the <span style="color: #8a0303;">**PCE**</span> and a course of class struggle for the <span style="color: #c00000;">**PSOE**</span>.

- @building_the_left
- @kpd_cooperation
- @regional_affairs
- @against_toleration
- @snap_election
- @root: Return to main

@building_the_left
title: Building the Left
subtitle: Push the <span style="color: #c00000;">**PSOE**</span> to the left.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_strength += 6; left_dissent -= 8; reformist_dissent += 2

We have increased the strength of the Caballerista left within the <span style="color: #c00000;">**PSOE**</span>.

@kpd_cooperation
title: Cooperation with the <span style="color: #8a0303;">**PCE**</span>
subtitle: Push the party to be more friendly towards the <span style="color: #8a0303;">**PCE**</span>.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; left_strength += 5; pce_relation += 4*(1-dissent); reformist_dissent += 2; communist_coalition += 1 if kpd_cooperation_seen <= 1; kpd_cooperation_seen += 1

Araquistáin argues tirelessly for a united front of the working-class parties; this opens some connections with the <span style="color: #8a0303;">**PCE**</span>.

@regional_affairs
title: Catalan Self-Government
subtitle: The Caballerista left backs the Catalan Statute as a blow against the centralist right.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and psoe_in_government
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if not psoe_in_government : The <span style="color: #c00000;">PSOE</span> is not in government. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; catalan_affairs_timer -= 6; last_advisor_action = 1
go-to: catalan_affairs

@against_toleration
title: Against toleration
subtitle: Withdraw the PSOE's support and force a government crisis.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if psoe_toleration == 0 : The <span style="color: #c00000;">PSOE</span> is not currently tolerating a government. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and psoe_toleration
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; next_election_time = time + 3 if next_election_time > time+3; next_election_month = month + 3 if next_election_time >= time + 3; next_election_year = year if next_election_time >= time + 3; next_election_year += 1 if next_election_month > 12; next_election_month -= 12 if next_election_month > 12; psoe_toleration = 0; left_strength += 8; pro_republic -= 4; coup_progress += 2; urban_middle_psoe -= 3; smallholder_psoe -= 3; catholic_psoe -= 3; reformist_dissent += 8; left_dissent -= 5; izq_rep_relation -= 8; radical_relation -= 4

Araquistáin has grown tired of propping up a government the party does not lead. We withdraw our support and throw the government into crisis.

New elections have been set for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +].

@snap_election
title: Snap Election
subtitle: Call a snap election.
unavailable-subtitle: [? if chancellor != "Araquistáin" and president != "Araquistáin" : Araquistáin must head the government or hold the presidency. ?][? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if president = "Araquistáin" and presidential_powers : We have removed this power from the president with a constitutional reform. ?]
choose-if: advisor_action_timer == 0 and (chancellor == "Araquistáin" or (president == "Araquistáin" and not presidential_powers))
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; next_election_time = time + 3 if next_election_time > time+3; next_election_month = month + 3 if next_election_time >= time+3; next_election_year = year if next_election_time >= time+3; next_election_year += 1 if next_election_month > 12; next_election_month -= 12 if next_election_month > 12;

We have called for new elections, set for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +].
